{"overview":"ناامیدی سیتارا پس از از دست دادن مادر و سرزمین مادری‌اش، با قدرت دانش به عزم و اراده تبدیل می‌شود. وقتی خانواده‌ای از دانشمندان او را به سرپرستی می‌گیرند و تحصیلاتش را عمیق‌تر می‌کنند، امکانات جدیدی آشکار می‌شود. در همین حال، امپراتوری مغول چنگیز خان ملت‌ها را یکی پس از دیگری فتح می‌کند و به خانه جدید سیتارا نزدیک می‌شود. پس از اینکه شاهزاده چهارم امپراتوری او را به اسارت می‌گیرد، شعله انتقام شعله‌ور می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"After losing her mother and her homeland, Sitara’s despair transforms into determination with the power of knowledge. New possibilities unfold when a family of scholars takes her in, deepening her education. Meanwhile, Genghis Khan’s Mongol Empire conquers nation after nation, nearing Sitara’s new home. After the Fourth Prince of the empire takes her captive, a flame of revenge is ignited.","tagline_en":"This is the tale of a witch who toyed with a vast continent.","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/A62nNZKHo1Ee8AjXHFAu6ykM66F.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"関根明良","role":"Sitara (voice)","photo":"/czYoPzAEK1gI7RxRiPyDSFYRm5x.jpg","en":"Akira Sekine"},{"name":"小清水亜美","role":"Töregene (voice)","photo":"/e5sU0stGjTMtFoj0jjHH7OFUqYC.jpg","en":"Ami Koshimizu"},{"name":"桑島法子","role":"Fatima (voice)","photo":"/uZSmoh5jSdLwmkLaCnC3Xju6TTN.jpg","en":"Houko Kuwashima"},{"name":"齋藤潤","role":"Muhammad (voice)","photo":"/tYbBtEvzm3dqwdxS0h61TVwqAfN.jpg","en":"Jun Saito"},{"name":"下野紘","role":"Ögedei (voice)","photo":"/yrSDcgFefHtWkFmLnTrcw2t0MV.jpg","en":"Hiro Shimono"},{"name":"ریوتا سوزوکی","role":"Tolui (voice)","photo":"/4Xq18mQttuW2yfRCflnWoU7UqQ5.jpg","en":"Ryota Suzuki"},{"name":"入野自由","role":"Shira (voice)","photo":"/8qEEhHUObNvGQr4e6eqLu5z4qTz.jpg","en":"Miyu Irino"},{"name":"浪川大輔","role":"Chagatai (voice)","photo":"/iw0X8oDutxaBAri3Ifga8nhdUJK.jpg","en":"Daisuke Namikawa"},{"name":"کنجی نوجیما","role":"Jochi (voice)","pho